<title>CROATIA: SOCCER-HAJDUK SPLIT BEATS GREVENMACHER 2-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HAJDUK SPLIT BEATS GREVENMACHER 2-0.</headline>
<dateline>SPLIT, Croatia 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a UEFA Cup first preliminary round second leg match played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Hajduk Split (Croatia) 2  Grevenmacher (Luxembourg) 0 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Josip Bulat 61, Tomislav Erceg 89</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
<p>Hajduk won 6-1 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
